# {{.DisplayName}}

Auto-generated Ruby SDK from OpenAPI schema.

## Installation

Add this line to your application's Gemfile:

```ruby
gem '{{.SDKName}}'
```

And then execute:

```bash
bundle install
```

Or install it yourself as:

```bash
gem install {{.SDKName}}
```

## Usage

```ruby
require '{{.SDKName}}'

# Initialize the client
client = {{.ModuleName}}::{{.ClientClassName}}.new(base_url: '{{.BaseURL}}')

{{if .HasAuth}}
# With authentication
